    <!-- First-launch guide -->
    <string name="guide_title">Before you start</string>
    <string name="guide_1">Experimental, unofficial software with no vehicle safety certification. It does not replace the factory dashcam, reversing camera or blind-spot monitor. Do not use it while driving, and do not rely on its picture to judge the road.</string>
    <string name="guide_2">Recordings go to the USB drive only; without a drive, recording does not start. Recordings are not encrypted: anyone with the drive can read them.</string>
    <string name="guide_3">The menu is at the top left. Put the action buttons on the driver\'s side in Settings → Interface → Button side. The super mirror is off by default; turn it on in Settings → Super mirror.</string>
    <string name="guide_4">If something goes wrong, restart the app. If it continues, export a report from Settings → About → Diagnostics and attach it to an issue.</string>
    <string name="action_got_it_guide">Got it</string>

